# Cloudflare Pages redirects — applied at edge before static serve.
# Format: <from>   <to>   <status>
# Notes:
#   - 301 = permanent (good for canonical), 302 = temporary
#   - Astro emits /index.html with a <meta refresh> already, but the redirect
#     here avoids the meta-refresh hop for users hitting the apex.

/   /cs/   302
